#: config.cpp:41
msgid "Draw titlebar &stipple effect"
msgstr "Lukis papan tajuk dengan ke&san berbintik"

#: config.cpp:43
msgid ""
"When selected, active titlebars are drawn with a stipple (dotted) effect. "
"Otherwise, they are drawn without the stipple."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dipilih, papan tajuk aktif akan dilukis dengan kesan berbintik. "
"Jika tidak papan tajuk dilukis tanpa bintik."

#: config.cpp:47
msgid "Draw g&rab bar below windows"
msgstr "Lukis papan ta&rik di bawah tetingkap"

#: config.cpp:49
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab bar\" below windows. "
"Otherwise, no grab bar is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dipilih, dekorasi akan dilukis dengan \"papan tarik\" di bawah tetingkap. "
"Jika tidak, tiada papan tarik dilukis."

#: config.cpp:55
#, fuzzy
msgid "Draw &gradients"
msgstr "Lukis"

#: config.cpp:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with gradients for highcolor displays, "
"otherwise no gradients are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dipilih, dekorasi akan dilukis dengan          untuk paparan warna tinggi, jika tidak "
"tiada     akan dilukis."

#: config.cpp:64
msgid "&Titlebar height:"
msgstr "Ketinggian papan &tajuk:"

#: config.cpp:70
msgid ""
"By adjusting this slider, you can modify the height of the titlebar to make "
"room for larger fonts."
msgstr ""
"Dengan menyelaraskan peluncur ini, anda boleh ubah ketinggian papan tajuk untuk memberi "
"ruang kepada font lebih besar."

#: config.cpp:75
msgid ""
"_: titlebar height\n"
"Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#: config.cpp:76
msgid ""
"_: titlebar height\n"
"Large"
msgstr "Besar"

#: config.cpp:78
msgid ""
"_: titlebar height\n"
"Huge"
msgstr "Sangat Besar"

